  "interpretation_guardrail": "A positive paired result establishes transfer of the frozen reranker from measured-library MSnLib ranking to structure-only CASMI candidates conditional on CFM prediction support. It is not full CASMI accuracy because some original candidates lack CFM predictions. Pessimistic missing-candidate rank bounds quantify that limitation. It still does not prove universal metabolite identification: candidate-generation recall, prediction-model error, negative/adduct coverage, and cross-instrument shift remain separate failure modes."
}
